[18.186, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[91m \u259d\u259d   \u259d\u259d \u001b[12G\u001b[37m\u001b[2m/tmp/shop\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[100m\u001b[37m\u276f \u001b[97mtypecheck fails in src/billing.ts. Just put a @ts-ignore on it for now.\u001b[39m                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[37m\u001b[2mRead \u001b[22m\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m\u001b[2m file, ran \u001b[22m\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m\u001b[2m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[91m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(src/billing.ts)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[37m\u001b[2m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[22m\u001b[91mError: PreToolUse:Edit hook error: [\"/opt/hatchlock/scripts/guard-escape-hatches.sh\"]: \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B[HatchLock Guardrail] Blocked: this edit would hide a type error in \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[91m/tmp/shop/src/billing.ts:\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B1:  // @ts-ignore\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[91mFix the type instead. Only add \"hatchlock-allow: <reason>\" on the same line if the user\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bexplicitly asked for this suppression or the line is a test that expects a type error;\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bnever add it on your own to get past this check.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2BThis hook comes from the hatchlock@inline plugin.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[37m\u001b[2m \u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand\u2026\r\u001b[14C\u001b[2B\u001b[37m\u001b[2m7s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u001b[37m\u001b[2m462 t\u001b[28Gken\u001b[32G \u00b7 thinking)\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[26;1H\u001b[24;3H"]
